; A terrain set: the images the editor's terrain importer makes a terrain from (ADR 0046 S20).
heightmap onisle1_heightmap.png
colormap onisle1_colormap.png
detail onisle1_detail.png
surface onisle1_surface.png
foliagemap onisle1_foliage.png
foliage
  graphic onundr1.3di
  match 254
  color_lower 0
  color_upper 2
  attrib shadow
end
foliage
  graphic ongrass1.3di
  match 253
  color_lower 0
  color_upper 2
  attrib shadow
end
